OL,5,G0130 Shop on TV
OL,6,G0300 Prue Leith's Cotswold Kitchen
OL,7,     FPrue is joined in her kitchen by
OL,8,     Freality TV star Gemma Collins, who
OL,9,     Fcooks her favourite crispy lamb
OL,10,     Fcutlets with a Parmesan crumb.
OL,11,     FPrue also makes herbed salmon
OL,12,     Fparcels with a pea puree and lemon
OL,13,     Fmayo, while her husband John heads
OL,14,     Foff to Paddock Farm to see his
OL,15,     Ffavourite Tamworth pigs
OL,16,G0350 Unwind with STV
OL,17,     FDaily escape designed to calm the
OL,18,     Fmind and encourage relaxation and
OL,19,     Freflection
