OL,5,G0505 The Joy of Pets
OL,6,     FGaby Roslin and vet Bolu Eso head
OL,7,     Fto Ipswich, where they meet a
OL,8,     Fflock of chickens, Maine Coon
OL,9,     Fcats, Tiddles the tortoise and
OL,10,     Fsome giant African land snails.
OL,11,     FGaby also encounters a remarkable
OL,12,     Fmedical-detection dog whose
OL,13,     Fextraordinary skills have
OL,14,     Ftransformed her owner's life, Bolu
OL,15,     Fvisits a local veterinary
OL,16,     Fpractice, and there is a trip to a
OL,17,     Fbird of prey sanctuary, where some
OL,18,     Fspectacular residents are waiting
OL,19,     Fto spread their wings
